arm64: dts: anbernic h700: charge at the stock 1.5 A

The vendor device trees of every H700 model set pmu_runtime_chgcur to 1500 mA.
At 1.024 A the handheld charges about a third slower.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-2024.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h700-anbernic-rg35xx-2024.dts
@@ -35,7 +35,8 @@
 
 	battery: battery {
 		compatible = "simple-battery";
-		constant-charge-current-max-microamp = <1024000>;
+		/* Anbernic's firmware charges every H700 model at 1.5 A while running. */
+		constant-charge-current-max-microamp = <1500000>;
 		voltage-max-design-microvolt = <4200000>;
 	};
 
